00:37:51.740 --> 00:38:03.429
Andy Woodruff: We were not fond of Google Docs' cumbersome ability to track multiple proposed changes at the same time, or its visibility into who made what changes.

283
00:38:03.720 --> 00:38:08.909
Andy Woodruff: Since moving to GitHub, everything is in Markdown, or JSON, and is tracked.

284
00:38:09.250 --> 00:38:13.000
Andy Woodruff: The GitHub repository holds the actual governance documents.

