00:39:35.430 --> 00:39:54.160
Andy Woodruff: We are actively in talks to bring in two additional colonies in the form of news and a gaming community. With this, over the next couple months, we will need to finalize our governance framework and the colony extension model, as well as draft those colony extensions to support new members and new content verticals.

